Third-party runtime dependencies (Rust crates, see Cargo.lock for exact
versions): tokio, axum, hyper, rusqlite (bundled SQLite — public domain),
serde, serde_json, sha2, hex, uuid, zip, rand, regex, ureq, futures-util,
include_dir, windows-sys. The embedded frontend includes React, React DOM,
and Scheduler. Vite and TypeScript are build tools.

The include_dir 0.7.4 crate and its macros share the MIT license from their
source commit d742c6fffce99ee89da91b934e7ce6fb2a82680c. See
licenses/include_dir-0.7.4.txt. CI artifacts carry the collected dependency
license texts alongside the executable.

